## Data Model

### GCP — BigQuery Silver Layer

**price_5min_avg** — 5-minute windowed average price per flight
```
flight_number, route_id, origin, destination, airline_code, airline_name,
window_start, window_end, avg_price_usd, min_price_usd, max_price_usd,
message_count, processing_timestamp
```
Note: May contain duplicates from accumulating mode. Deduplication in Spark.

**price_1hr_trend** — 1-hour sliding window average per flight
```
flight_number, route_id, origin, destination, airline_code,
window_start, window_end, avg_price_usd, message_count, processing_timestamp
```

**late_arrivals** — messages arriving >2 minutes after event time
```
route_id, flight_number, origin, destination, airline_code, price_usd,
flight_date, event_timestamp, ingestion_timestamp, lateness_seconds,
processing_timestamp
```

**pipeline_watermarks** — tracks last processed timestamp per pipeline
```
pipeline_name, last_processed_ts, updated_at
```

**pipeline_audit_log** — daily pipeline run summary
```
run_date, run_timestamp, silver_rows, gold_rows,
late_arrivals, late_rate, reconciled_count, status
```

### GCP — BigQuery Gold Layer

**Grain:** One row in `fact_flight_prices` = one flight × one 5-minute window

**fact_flight_prices**
```
flight_key (FK), airline_key (FK), date_key (FK),
window_start, window_end,
avg_price_usd, min_price_usd, max_price_usd, message_count,
is_anomaly, z_score, created_at
```

**dim_flights (SCD Type 2)**
```
flight_key (surrogate), flight_number (natural),
route_id, origin, destination, airline_code,
effective_date, expiry_date, is_current
```

**dim_airlines**
```
airline_key, airline_code, airline_name, alliance, is_domestic
```

**dim_date**
```
date_key, date, day_of_week, day_number,
is_weekend, month, quarter, is_us_holiday, season
```

### Snowflake Layer

**SILVER.raw_flights** — raw AviationStack schedule data
```
flight_date, flight_status, departure_airport, departure_iata,
departure_scheduled, arrival_airport, arrival_iata, arrival_scheduled,
airline_name, airline_iata, flight_number, flight_iata,
codeshared_airline, codeshared_flight, raw_json, loaded_at
```

**GOLD.flight_price_summary** — per flight per day with prices
```
flight_number, route_id, origin, destination, airline_name, alliance,
date, is_weekend, season, avg_price_usd, min_price_usd, max_price_usd,
anomaly_count, window_count, loaded_at
```

**GOLD.route_stats** — per route per day aggregated
```
route_id, origin, destination, date, airline_count,
cheapest_airline, min_price_usd, avg_price_usd, max_price_usd,
anomaly_count, loaded_at
```

**ANALYTICS.hourly_route_summary** — Dynamic Table, auto-refreshes hourly
```
route_id, origin, destination, date, season, is_weekend,
airline_count, avg_price, min_price, max_price,
total_anomalies, last_updated
```

