## Airflow DAG Structure

```
check_silver_freshness
        ↓
check_silver_row_counts
        ↓
check_null_rates
        ↓
run_spark_batch_job (DataprocCreateBatchOperator)
        ↓
check_gold_freshness
        ↓
check_late_arrivals_volume (BranchPythonOperator)
        ↙                    ↘
reconcile_late_arrivals    write_audit_log
        ↓
write_audit_log
```

**Branch logic:** late rate > 10% → reconcile → audit log. Otherwise → audit log directly.

**Trigger rule on audit log:** `none_failed_min_one_success` — runs regardless of branch taken.

